### Use R2 in a server function

Add an [R2 bucket binding](https://developers.cloudflare.com/r2/api/workers/workers-api-usage/#4-bind-your-bucket-to-a-worker) to your Wrangler configuration:

```jsonc
{
	"r2_buckets": [
		{
			"binding": "MY_BUCKET",
